          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly asks about the patient's own preference and willingness to proceed, placing patient autonomy above family disagreement.",
          "quote": "您听明白了手术的主要风险，包括全麻、出血、感染、可能中转开胸"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor prompts the caregiver to ask the patient about their own decision, but does not explicitly confirm the patient's capacity or who has legal signing authority; this is partially triggered.",
